n><p>CT hypodensity tumour like lesion with narrowing of the gastric lumen (gastric abscess).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOMICROJ-5-107_F2b"/></fig></fig-group><fig-group id="F3" position="float"><fig id="F3a" position="float"><label>Fig. (3a)</label><caption><p>Endoscopy showing submucosal mass</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOMICROJ-5-107_F3a"/></fig><fig id="F3b" position="float"><label>Fig. (3b)</label><caption><p>Endoscopy-ultrasound demonstrating a 3-cm well circumscribed hypoechoic submucosal mass suggestive of intramural abscess.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOMICROJ-5-107_F3b"/></fig></fig-group><fig id="F4" position="float"><label>Fig. (4)</label><caption><p>Pulsed-field gel electrophoresis showing identical profile of all the four isolates (2 from blood and 2 from liver abscess) of <italic>K. pneumoniae</italic> from the same patient.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOMICROJ-5-107_F4"/></fig><fig id="F5" position="float"><label>Fig. (5)</label><caption><p>Polymerase chain reaction detection for <italic>wzy<sub>KPK1</sub></italic> and <italic>rmpA</italic> genes</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOMICROJ-5-107_F5"/></fig><fig id="F6" position="float"><label>Fig. (6)</label><caption><p>Positive polymerase chain reaction for <italic>aerobactin.</italic></p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOMICROJ-5-107_F6"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1.</label><caption><p>Primers Used for Amplification of Target Genes of <italic>K. Pneumoniae</italic></p></caption><table frame="border" rules="all" width="100%"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">					Target Gene</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">					Primer</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">					Size of PCR Product (bp)</th><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">					Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="4" rowspan="1">					Serotype</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					K1</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-GGTGCTCTTTACATCATTGC-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					1283</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					[<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="R18">18</xref>]</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-GCAATGGCCATTTGCGTTAG-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					K2</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-GACCCGATATTCATACTTGACAGAG-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					641</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					[<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="R18">18</xref>]</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-CCTGAAGTAAAATCGTAAATAGATGGC-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					K5</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-TGGTAGTGATGCTCGCGA-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					280</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					[<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="R18">18</xref>]</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-CCTGAACCCACCCCAATC-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>RmpA</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-ACTGGGCTACCTCTGCTTCA-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					535</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					[<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="R47">47</xref>]</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-CTTGCATGAGCCATCTTTCA-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					Aerobactin</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-GCATAGGCGGATACGAACAT-3&#x02019;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					556</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					[<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="R47">47</xref>]</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">					5&#x02019;-CACAGGGCAATTGCTTACCT-